OL,3,GNEWSAMidwives told to expect fewer jobs
OL,4,Aas recruitment drive is paused
OL,5,
OL,6,FMidwives who will graduate in Wales
OL,7,Fnext year have been told there are
OL,8,Ffewer jobs available for them than
OL,9,Fexpected.
OL,11,FThe Royal College of Midwives said this
OL,12,Fis in addition to the 66 newly
OL,13,Fqualified midwives who didn't manage to
OL,14,Ffind a job after they graduated last
OL,15,Fyear.
OL,17,FDirector of RCM Cymru Julie Richards
OL,18,Fsaid the situation was "unacceptable"
OL,19,Fwhen maternity services are "facing
OL,20,Fpressure from every direction".
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
