OL,3,GNEWSAMidwives told to expect fewer jobs
OL,4,Aas recruitment drive is paused
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government said it recognised
OL,7,Fthe concerns around employment
OL,8,Funcertainty and it was working with NHS
OL,9,FWales "to understand workforce
OL,10,Fpressures and requirements".
